        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-full w-full lg:w-1/2 px-4 wow flipInX" data-wow-duration="1s" data-wow-delay=".1s">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl leading-normal md:leading-tight mb-4 font-bold text-base-content">Creative Digital Agency</h2>
        <p class="text-base-content/70 leading-relaxed font-light text-xl mx-auto pb-2 mb-12">You will get all statistic from your business. Upgency tells you exactly what kind of financial information you need to enter and then it does all the calculations automatically using built-in formulas. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy.</p>
        <a href="#services" class="py-3 px-5 inline-block text-center rounded-md leading-normal text-primary-content bg-primary border border-primary hover:text-primary-content hover:bg-primary hover:ring-0 hover:border-primary focus:bg-primary focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-0">
          Our Services
          <svg class="bi bi-chevron-double-right inline-block ms-2 transform ltr:rotate-0 rtl:rotate-180" width=".8rem" height=".8rem" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M3.646 1.646a.5.5 0 01.708 0l6 6a.5.5 0 010 .708l-6 6a.5.5 0 01-.708-.708L9.293 8 3.646 2.354a.5.5 0 010-.708z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.646 1.646a.5.5 0 01.708 0l6 6a.5.5 0 010 .708l-6 6a.5.5 0 01-.708-.708L13.293 8 7.646 2.354a.5.5 0 010-.708z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
          </svg>
